      "changelog": "- Initial release of the do-cli skill, enabling terminal or agent-based interaction with the do personal todo and life-tracking app.\n- Command-line interface provides secure, agent-safe API access for capturing, reviewing, and completing tasks, as well as logging habits and reading entities.\n- Per-tenant API-key authentication with flexible config options; no destructive actions (create, update, delete) are allowed.\n- Auto-detects JSON output for agent/pipe use; clear exit codes for error handling.\n- Comprehensive help and manifest available via do help --json for both human and automated discovery.",
